s been resolved into individual enantiomers by formation of the diastereomeric tartrate salts.\nsec-Butylamine is used in the production of some pesticides.", "rischi": "The LD50 (rat) for primary alkylamines is on the order of 100 – 1,000 mg/kg.\n\n== References ==", "titolo": "Sec-Butylamine", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sec-Butylamine"}, "wikipedia_titoli": {"en": "Sec-Butylamine"}}